1
00:00:49,930 --> 00:00:52,430
I can't believe they actually
arrested you as a spy.

2
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:53,960
Heaven is truly helping me.

3
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:56,230
As long as I kill you to silence you,

4
00:00:56,230 --> 00:00:58,000
no one will know my identity.

5
00:01:03,130 --> 00:01:04,700
Y-Y-You stay away.

6
00:01:05,530 --> 00:01:07,630
But that power in you is very special.

7
00:01:08,060 --> 00:01:09,660
It'd be a pity to just kill you.

8
00:01:09,660 --> 00:01:12,260
Why don't I dig out
your spiritual veins first?

9
00:01:15,060 --> 00:01:16,200
Stay away from me!

10
00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:21,120
Don't worry. The Demonic Sect's
soul-extracting curse is very fast.

11
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,930
Once you become an empty shell,

12
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:25,330
no one will know my identity.

13
00:01:48,100 --> 00:01:49,229
U-U-Uncle...

14
00:02:01,930 --> 00:02:04,000
Sect Leader, her old injuries
haven't healed,

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:05,160
and she has new ones.

16
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:06,530
Plus the shock,

17
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,830
she needs to take some medicine

18
00:02:07,830 --> 00:02:08,759
and rest well.

19
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,160
Hmm, I got it.

20
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,530
Then I will take my leave first.

21
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:29,930
What does the doctor mean
by leaving the medicine here?

22
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:32,260
Does he expect me
to feed that girl myself?

23
00:02:43,530 --> 00:02:45,329
Why are mortals so troublesome?

24
00:02:51,730 --> 00:02:52,530
Sect Leader.

25
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:58,130
It's nothing. Please continue,
Sect Leader.

26
00:03:02,030 --> 00:03:03,130
Come back.

27
00:03:03,130 --> 00:03:04,930
What is it? Speak.

28
00:03:07,200 --> 00:03:08,960
The spy you caught last night
using Ms. Kong as bait

29
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,100
had a Demonic Sect mark on his arm.

30
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:14,160
But he has already taken poison
and killed himself.

31
00:03:15,600 --> 00:03:16,600
I know.

32
00:03:16,630 --> 00:03:18,230
You stay and take care of her.

33
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:24,960
The Sect Leader really cares
about Ms. Kong.

34
00:03:25,300 --> 00:03:29,300
Looks like it's necessary to have
everyone change how they address her.

35
00:03:36,500 --> 00:03:37,560
It's so dark.

36
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,800
Come with me.

37
00:03:44,030 --> 00:03:46,300
Who? Who is talking?

38
00:03:46,430 --> 00:03:47,560
Come with me.

39
00:03:48,030 --> 00:03:50,600
You said you would stay with me
lifetime after lifetime.

40
00:03:50,600 --> 00:03:51,400
No!

41
00:04:04,030 --> 00:04:05,330
This voice again.

42
00:04:05,930 --> 00:04:07,030
What is it calling?

43
00:04:12,530 --> 00:04:14,360
Sister, what's wrong?

44
00:04:14,530 --> 00:04:15,930
Did you have a nightmare?

45
00:04:20,459 --> 00:04:21,360
I'm fine.

46
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:23,930
Just had a messy dream.

47
00:04:24,860 --> 00:04:26,600
Someone was talking to me in the dream,

48
00:04:26,600 --> 00:04:28,330
but I can't remember anything.

49
00:04:29,830 --> 00:04:30,730
Don't be afraid, Sister.

50
00:04:30,730 --> 00:04:31,900
Dreams are fake.

51
00:04:31,930 --> 00:04:34,200
When I was little, I often dreamed of being
chased and beaten by the old monster.

52
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,530
I was fine when I woke up.

53
00:04:36,700 --> 00:04:39,560
Aren't you still often chased
and beaten by him now?

54
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:48,360
Sister, let me tell you a secret.

55
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:51,200
Although the old monster keeps
a straight face every day,

56
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:53,600
he is actually very afraid
of being lonely.

57
00:04:53,900 --> 00:04:55,530
He has lived for over a thousand years.

58
00:04:55,530 --> 00:04:57,960
The people around him either died or left.

59
00:04:58,130 --> 00:05:00,230
Don't mind him being fierce to you now.

60
00:05:00,230 --> 00:05:03,160
He actually... probably just doesn't know

61
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,730
how to treat someone well.

62
00:05:05,630 --> 00:05:08,760
Afraid of being lonely?
Lived for over a thousand years?

63
00:05:10,630 --> 00:05:11,400
So, Sister,

64
00:05:11,400 --> 00:05:12,530
don't be afraid of him.

65
00:05:12,530 --> 00:05:13,900
If you can make him smile more,

66
00:05:13,900 --> 00:05:15,700
maybe he won't bear to let you go.

67
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:19,330
What do you take me for? A pistachio?

68
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,760
Yeah.

69
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:26,530
A thousand-year-old monster
afraid of loneliness,

70
00:05:26,530 --> 00:05:28,700
and me who remembers nothing.

71
00:05:29,300 --> 00:05:30,500
In a way,

72
00:05:30,830 --> 00:05:32,560
we don't seem to be any different.
